  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fostering Reconciliation in BiH Communities - &quot;Mo&#xbf;emo Bolje&#xbf;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Fostering Reconciliation in BiH Communities - &quot;Mo&#xbf;emo Bolje&#xbf; - The overall objective of the action is to enhance cohesion among social and community groups across ethnic lines in Bosnia and Herzegovina, by building trust and resillience to tensions, in line with the European Commission&#xbf;s priority 5 regarding the need for Bosnia and Herzegovina to &#xbf;create an environment conducive to reconciliation&#xbf; in the Opinion on the application of Bosnia and Herzegovina for EU membership.</narrative>
  </description>
